# Paths under landing/ that must never be published.
#
# This is a safety net, not the primary defence. The deploy uploads whatever
# sits in this directory, so anything that is not part of the site must not live
# here in the first place — a 4.9 MB node_modules tree from an abandoned demo
# experiment used to, and would have shipped.
#
# Patterns follow the form Cloudflare documents for Workers static assets.
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/.git
